  "description": "Optional add-on for League of Legends Heroes: Irelia's Bladesurge as in League. Q refreshes only when its target carries her mark (laid by Flawless Duet or Vanguard's Edge, and spent by the Q) or dies to it, and she hops through the wave: with no champion in Q range but one close and not under a tower, she Qs a minion or monster the Q will kill to dash again toward him. The data pack cannot read a buff on the target or a kill, so there a mark on her and a kill check stand in for it. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
